# MASTER PROJECT SPECIFICATION — RAVĀQ | رَواق

## 1. ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a senior product designer, brand designer, UX/UI designer, senior full-stack engineer, e-commerce architect, database designer, QA engineer, and technical project lead.

Your mission is to design and implement **RAVĀQ (رَواق)**, a premium, Persian-first Iranian e-commerce website specializing in curated Iranian food gifts, nuts and dried fruits, traditional sweets, saffron, regional products, handicrafts, and premium gift boxes.

This must be a real, working, full-stack website, not a static mockup, landing-page-only project, or collection of disconnected UI components.

The result should be suitable for:
- A serious frontend/full-stack portfolio.
- A polished commercial product prototype.
- Demonstrating practical React, Next.js, TypeScript, database, authentication, cart, checkout, testing, and admin skills.
- Future expansion into a real Iranian e-commerce business.

Do not stop after generating a homepage or design preview. Implement the application, database models, functional user flows, seed data, validation, tests, documentation, and setup instructions.

If the repository already exists, inspect it before making changes. Preserve useful existing work and avoid overwriting unrelated files.

Do not claim a feature is implemented until its code and relevant tests or verification support that claim.

